    <router-link to="/demo-export">{{ isEn ? 'Compare real export results' : '对比实际导出结果' }} →</router-link>
    <h2 id="state-coordinates">{{ isEn ? 'Preview, state and source coordinates' : '预览、状态与源图坐标，各有用途' }}</h2>
    <ul><li><code>real-time</code> — {{ isEn ? 'Render a lightweight live preview from the provided image styles.' : '用事件提供的图片样式渲染轻量实时预览。' }}</li><li><code>change</code> — {{ isEn ? 'Observe image transforms and the crop box in workspace coordinates.' : '观察图片变换及容器坐标系中的裁剪框状态。' }}</li><li><code>getCropCoordinates()</code> — {{ isEn ? 'Read four selection corners in the orientation-normalized source image. Rotated corners and their bounding box are different shapes.' : '读取方向校正后源图中的四个选区角点。旋转后，角点组成的区域与轴对齐包围盒不同。' }}</li><li><code>getCropBlob()</code> — {{ isEn ? 'Export when needed; no need to export on every preview update.' : '按需导出，无需在每次预览更新时重复调用。' }}</li></ul>
